WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:52.470
[BUGGY]
Those three think they can mock me?

38
00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:53.640
Screw that!

39
00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:57.970
I consider this act of
aggression a declaration of war.

40
00:01:58.720 --> 00:02:01.180
[BUGGY]
There you are, Mohji.

41
00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:06.270
<b>Mohji "the Beast Tamer"
First Mate of the Buggy Pirates</b>

42
00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:06.270
I hope you wouldn't mind if
I take the Pirate Hunter's head.

43
00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.690
[BUGGY laughs]
Be my guest.

44
00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:19.120
Huh?

45
00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:25.500
<b>Treasure</b>

46
00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:22.370
[LUFFY]
Huh?

47
00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:23.290
Huh?

48
00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.880
[ZORO]
What's with this dog?

49
00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:29.550
Doggie!

50
00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:38.760
Zoro, it looks like this dog is frozen.

51
00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:39.640
[ZORO]
I don't give a damn.

52
00:02:39.640 --> 00:02:43.230
He could sit there
forever, for all I care.

53
00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:44.390
I wonder if it's dead.

54
00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:56.450
[LUFFY]
Get off! Get off! Get off! Get off!

55
00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:01.330
Luffy, please, quit goofing
around and get serious!

56
00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:05.580
[LUFFY]
Damn dog...

57
00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.290
[ZORO]
I don't feel good...

58
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:11.250
[NAMI]
Huh?

59
00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.720
Oh! Hi, navigator.

60
00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:15.010
I guess you can have this.

61
00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:17.390
You got me out of a
pretty sticky situation.

62
00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:20.810
Great! The key to the cage!

63
00:03:20.810 --> 00:03:22.520
Did you go and steal if for me?

64
00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.310
Thanks, Nami!

65
00:03:24.310 --> 00:03:25.850
I only did it so we'd be even.

66
00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:28.400
Yeah, sure!

67
00:03:42.830 --> 00:03:43.750
[LUFFY]
Stupid, stupid dog!

68
00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.290
[LUFFY] Give it back!
That's not yours!

69
00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.460
Give me my key!

70
00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.130
Give it! Give it! Give it!

71
00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:51.920
[BOODLE]
Hey! Stop that!

72
00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:52.670
[NAMI]
Huh?

73
00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:55.130
Stop picking on poor Chouchou!

74
00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.420
Leave him alone!

75
00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.760
[barking]

76
00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:00.470
And who might you be old man?

77
00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:03.220
Old man? Why, I'm the
mayor of this town!

78
00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:06.390
<b>Boodle
Harbor Village Mayor</b>

79
00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.930
Who are you and why are
you hurting Chouchou? Huh?

80
00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:14.860
How's Zoro?

81
00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:19.200
I told him he really should see a doctor,
but he insisted that he didn't need to

82
00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:20.870
and just wanted to sleep it off.

83
00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.870
[NAMI]
dog's name is Chouchou?

84
00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:26.290
[LUFFY laughs]

85
00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.120
Why is he just sitting there like that?

86
00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:30.290
He sure is a lazy dog.

87
00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.340
He's guarding the store.

88
00:04:33.090 --> 00:04:36.920
Oh! I see. It's a pet food shop!

89
00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.260
[BOODLE]
That's right.

90
00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:42.260
And the man who used to run this
store was a very close friend of mine.

91
00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.140
[BOODLE]
There ya' go.

92
00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:55.020
When he passed, I assumed the responsibility
of taking care of Chouchou.

93
00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:56.820
[NAMI]
He died?

94
00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.240
[BOODLE]
Yes.

95
00:04:58.240 --> 00:05:03.070
Three months ago, after fighting
his illness for a very long time.

96
00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:08.080
[NAMI] Don't tell me he's been waiting
for his master to return all this time.

97
00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:10.500
[BOODLE]
That seems to be the consensus.

98
00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.040
[NAMI]
Huh...

99
00:05:17.590 --> 00:05:21.130
But I find that very hard to believe.

100
00:05:21.130 --> 00:05:23.930
Chouchou is a smart dog.

101
00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:28.850
He's probably known for a while
that his master isn't coming back.

102
00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.810
Then... why does he
stay here at the store?

103
00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:37.360
I guess because he has
a connection to it.

104
00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:39.150
It's his... treasure.

105
00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.530
He's guarding it.

106
00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:45.490
His master left him with this shop
and that's why he protects it.

107
00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:49.080
I've tried to bring him back to my place,
so he won't be out in the elements,

108
00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:52.080
but he won't take so much
as a step away from here.

109
00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:08.810
[NAMI]
Huh? What's that sound?

110
00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:09.720
[BOODLE]
It's him!

111
00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:12.230
Beast Tamer Mohji! We gotta go! Run!

112
00:06:13.440 --> 00:06:15.310
[NAMI]
What do you mean by "Beast Tamer"?

113
00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:18.020
– [NAMI] Wait! Hold On!
– [BOODLE] Get outta here!

114
00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.940
C'mon puppy, something's here.

115
00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:22.070
Why don't you just
give me that key back?

116
00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:24.910
[LUFFY]
Uhh...

117
00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:26.660
[LION growling]

118
00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:29.120
I see that your friends
have deserted you.

119
00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:31.540
And after you just escaped.

120
00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:33.250
[LUFFY]
Who the heck are you?

121
00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:35.420
I'm known as the "Beast Tamer Mohji,"

122
00:06:35.420 --> 00:06:37.590
a member of the Buggy Pirates.

123
00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:40.840
Whoa, that's a weird
animal suit you got on.

124
00:06:40.840 --> 00:06:42.470
That was rude!

125
00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.930
This is manly hair!

126
00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:45.680
'K, That's even weirder.

127
00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:49.760
You shouldn't assume that you're safe
just because you're in that cage.

128
00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.970
You must not know of
my terrifying skill!

129
00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:53.850
There is no animal in this world

130
00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:57.940
that Beast Tamer Mohji
can't bend to do his bidding.

131
00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:59.480
Shake...

132
00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:01.900
– [MOHJI screaming]
– [CHOUCHOU growling]

133
00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:02.860
Why does it hurt so bad?!

134
00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:05.910
You nameless thief, I've
no interest in killing you!

135
00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:10.200
But tell me where Roronoa Zoro
is before I change my mind.

136
00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:11.330
No way!

137
00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:13.830
Richie, Attack!

138
00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:16.460
[RICHIE roars]

139
00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:19.840
[LUFFY laughs]
Yes! I'm finally out!

140
00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:20.840
[LUFFY grunts]

141
00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.300
Nice work.

142
00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:28.090
Good boy, Richie!

143
00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:33.270
Now let's go find Zoro so I can defeat
him and strengthen my reputation.

144
00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.480
What's, wrong?

145
00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:38.440
Oh, it's a pet food store.
Make it quick, then let's go.

146
00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:40.980
[RICHIE roars]

147
00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:41.900
[MOHJI]
Huh?

148
00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:47.150
Don't tell me this pathetic little thing
really thinks he can guard the shop.

149
00:07:48.450 --> 00:07:50.950
[barking]

150
00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.910
[LUFFY]
Whew, that was intense!

151
00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.750
At least now, I'm out of that cage.

152
00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:57.830
[LUFFY]
He.He.

153
00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:02.340
Now, first thing, I teach those Buggy
Pirates a lesson and then I convince Nami

154
00:08:02.340 --> 00:08:04.340
to be the navigator for my crew.

155
00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:04.920
[NAMI]
Huh?

156
00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:06.590
How'd you survive that attack?!

157
00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:07.630
You're alive?!

158
00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.430
I just got lucky, I guess.

159
00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:11.970
Surviving an attack
like that isn't normal.

160
00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:14.390
I figured you'd be scattered all over.

161
00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:15.930
[LUFFY]
It's not normal?

162
00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.730
Why exactly did you decide
to come to this town,

163
00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:20.900
and how'd you get involved
with those pirates?

164
00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:23.730
All I'm doing is searching
for a chart of the Grand Line

165
00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.740
and a good navigator
to join my pirate crew.

166
00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:27.740
[NAMI gasps]

167
00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:32.700
[LUFFY] I think that guy in the animal suit said
he was looking for Zoro, so, I gotta go!

168
00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.910
[RICHIE roaring]

169
00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.410
[CHOUCHOU growls]

170
00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.290
[CHOUCHOU yelps]

171
00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:44.250
[CHOUCHOU growling]

172
00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.840
[OWNER] Chouchou? This shop
belongs to the two of us now.

173
00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:48.840
[barks]

174
00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:56.560
Ha. Ha. That bag is way
too big for you, Chouchou.

175
00:08:56.560 --> 00:09:00.520
[RICHIE growls]
[CHOUCHOU snarling]

176
00:09:02.730 --> 00:09:05.520
[CHOUCHOU barking]

177
00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.530
[OWNER grunts]

178
00:09:08.530 --> 00:09:10.360
[CHOUCHOU grunts]

179
00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.620
[OWNER laughs]

180
00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:15.030
Be careful, Chouchou.
Don't hurt yourself.

181
00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:16.540
Leave this to me!

182
00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:18.540
[barking]

183
00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:20.370
[OWNER]
Hmm. Bad Chouchou!

184
00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.580
I told you not to eat the merchandise.

185
00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.790
Now, let's chow down!

186
00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:28.840
[CHOUCHOU yelps]

187
00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:34.850
[CHOUCHOU, RICHIE growling]

188
00:09:34.850 --> 00:09:38.140
Well... Not ready to give up yet?

189
00:09:38.140 --> 00:09:40.180
[CHOUCHOU growling]

190
00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.980
[OWNER] Chouchou,
I'm getting on in years now.

191
00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:45.150
I gotta go see the
doctor for a checkup.

192
00:09:45.150 --> 00:09:48.900
But I'll be back, so guard
the shop until I return.

193
00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:52.780
I'm counting on you, Chouchou.

194
00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:54.780
Hold down the fort!

195
00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:58.040
[CHOUCHOU, RICHIE growling]

196
00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:13.760
[CHOUCHOU barks]

197
00:10:16.430 --> 00:10:21.270
[CHOUCHOU barks]

198
00:10:21.270 --> 00:10:24.480
[OWNER laughs]
That tickles, Chouchou!

199
00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:27.110
[CHOUCHOU whimpers]

200
00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.950
[BOODLE]
He has a connection to it.

201
00:10:32.950 --> 00:10:34.660
It's his treasure.

202
00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:35.950
He's guarding it.

203
00:10:35.950 --> 00:10:39.990
His master left him with this shop
and that's why he protects it.

204
00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:51.260
[howls, barks]

205
00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.680
[barks, howls]

206
00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.600
[MOHJI]
Damn it!

207
00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:07.690
I can't believe that
annoying little dog bit me.

208
00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:09.610
[grunts]

209
00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:19.370
Wait, I thought I killed you.
What are you still doing alive?

210
00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:24.160
I'm afraid you can't get
rid of me that easily.

211
00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:27.420
This time crush his head
into the ground, Richie!

212
00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:30.670
[RICHIE roars]

213
00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:34.170
I'm not gonna be beaten by a lion.

214
00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:36.010
Gum-Gum...

215
00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:41.100
[LUFFY]
Hammer!

216
00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:44.640
[LUFFY grunts]

217
00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.230
[MOHJI whimpers]

218
00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:51.480
[MOHJI]
What are you?!

219
00:11:53.320 --> 00:11:57.150
Well... I ate the Gum-Gum Devil Fruit!

220
00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.280
[MOHJI gasps]
So then you have...

221
00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:03.120
... Devil Fruit powers like Captain
Buggy, but yours make you rubber?

222
00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.670
Sorry! I apologize for attacking!

223
00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:11.670
I don't want any trouble!

224
00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:14.130
[LUFFY] There's no reason
for you to apologize to me.

225
00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:17.220
Because of you, that dog will
never get his treasure back.

226
00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:19.840
[barking]

227
00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:23.720
And now... because of that,
I'm gonna kick your ass.

228
00:12:23.720 --> 00:12:25.390
[MOHJI whimpers, gasps]

229
00:12:25.390 --> 00:12:28.190
[LUFFY grunting]

230
00:12:28.190 --> 00:12:30.310
– [LUFFY yells]
– [MOHJI grunts]

231
00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.700
Pirates are all the same.

232
00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.920
They're all just a bunch
of heartless bastards.

233
00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:52.000
They destroy everything
that people hold dear,

234
00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.460
without giving it a second thought.

235
00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.210
Oh, you're alive, Pirate!

236
00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:58.420
You know, I thought
for sure that lion

237
00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.840
was gonna tear your
head off and end it all.

238
00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:04.510
And I wish he had, 'cause then there'd
be one less pirate in the world!

239
00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:07.810
Maybe I should kill you right
now before you can gather a crew

240
00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:09.390
and destroy everything else!

241
00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:12.060
[BOODLE] Come now,
there's no need for violence.

242
00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:13.730
[LUFFY]
As if you could ever kill me.

243
00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.190
[NAMI]
Well, maybe I'll try it and see!

244
00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.690
[BOODLE]
I said stop!

245
00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:18.530
What's with you people?!

246
00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:23.490
[NAMI gasps]

247
00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:29.290
[NAMI]
Huh?

248
00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:30.460
[LUFFY sighs]

249
00:13:30.460 --> 00:13:32.540
Sorry, but that's all
that I could save for ya'.

250
00:13:33.630 --> 00:13:36.090
That bastard lion ate
all the rest of it.

251
00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:38.420
[NAMI]
He...

252
00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:42.720
He fought the lion...
in order to save the dog's food?

253
00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:47.510
[LUFFY]
You fought well.

254
00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:50.430
Course I didn't actually
see you defend the store,

255
00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.480
but I can tell you gave it your all.

256
00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:10.410
[CHOUCHOU barks]

257
00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:11.580
Heh! Thanks!

258
00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.580
Good luck to you, too, doggie!

259
00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.880
[barking]

260
00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.720
[NAMI giggles]

261
00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.270
[BUGGY]
You were defeated?!

262
00:14:30.270 --> 00:14:31.230
How?!

263
00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:33.270
Uh, I'm very sorry, Captain.

264
00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:35.270
Sorry, I failed.

265
00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:38.610
Mohji, I can't believe you
were defeated by Zoro.

266
00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:40.280
No, it wasn't Zoro.

267
00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:41.610
It was that straw hat.

268
00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:42.490
What?!

269
00:14:42.490 --> 00:14:45.660
There's no way that skinny little punk
could have gotten the better of you!

270
00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:47.700
[MOHJI]
He's eaten the Gum...

271
00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:49.540
Now I'm really pissed off!

272
00:14:49.540 --> 00:14:52.370
Alright, Prepare all the
remaining Special Buggy Balls.

273
00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:55.370
I'm gonna blow this entire,
miserable town to smithereens!

274
00:14:56.880 --> 00:15:00.210
[NAMI]
Sorry about earlier.

275
00:15:00.210 --> 00:15:01.630
I didn't mean to yell at you.

276
00:15:01.630 --> 00:15:04.760
That's okay, you've been
under a lot of stress lately.

277
00:15:06.930 --> 00:15:09.970
But hey, no need to apologize.

278
00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:10.970
I'm pathetic!

279
00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:13.520
Chouchou and this young
one have fought so hard,

280
00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:16.520
and yet I, the mayor, have done
nothing but sit back and watch

281
00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:19.980
our town be obliterated by
Buggy and his despicable crew.

282
00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.610
Calm down! It's not that bad!

283
00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:26.320
Forty years ago, this whole area
was nothing but barren, rugged land.

284
00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:29.620
We all worked together to
create fields for our crops.

285
00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:32.950
We opened stores, and built
everything from the ground up.

286
00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:36.000
This town is a treasure
to me and all its citizens!

287
00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:41.460
From here on out, I refuse to let Buggy
and his crew terrorize us any more!

288
00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:43.260
[BUGGY]
Fire a Special Buggy Ball.

289
00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:45.010
Blow this town away!

290
00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:48.800
[BOODLE gasps]

291
00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:59.060
He'll destroy it all.

292
00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:01.610
Ah! Zoro was sleeping in there!

293
00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:04.190
[BOODLE]
I'm sure he's dead now.

294
00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:07.240
[LUFFY]
Zoro, you in there?!

295
00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:08.410
Are you still alive?!

296
00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:10.990
[ZORO] That's one hell
of a way to wake a guy up.

297
00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.700
[LUFFY laughs]

298
00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.080
[ZORO]
I coulda used a few more z's.

299
00:16:18.210 --> 00:16:20.380
How did you survive that blast?

300
00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:22.840
All right! You're alive!

301
00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:26.260
[BOODLE]
I refuse to let him get away with this.

302
00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:28.010
I won't stand for it.

303
00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:30.340
I can't let this scumbag destroy

304
00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:33.640
all that my townspeople worked
for these last forty years.

305
00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:39.020
[BOODLE]
I am the mayor of this town!

306
00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.360
I will protect it and it's inhabitants!

307
00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:44.940
I swear... to my dying breath!

308
00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:46.900
[NAMI]
Stop! You can't defeat Buggy!

309
00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:50.530
[BOODLE] Perhaps... but there are
some fights that a man can't run from!

310
00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:51.870
Isn't that right?!

311
00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:53.990
That's right, old man!

312
00:16:53.990 --> 00:16:55.990
Shut up! Don't egg him on, Luffy!

313
00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.620
It's dangerous for him to fight Buggy!

314
00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.040
I know that it's dangerous!

315
00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:07.800
[BOODLE]
I'm coming for you, Buggy the Clown!

316
00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:10.180
[NAMI]
The mayor was crying.

317
00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:12.640
[LUFFY]
He was? Huh, I didn't notice.

318
00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:14.850
[ZORO] Looks like the party's
getting more exciting!

319
00:17:14.850 --> 00:17:18.140
[LUFFY laughs]
Sure does.

320
00:17:18.140 --> 00:17:20.640
This is no time for laughter.

321
00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.520
Don't worry. I started to
grow fond of that old man.

322
00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.820
There's no way I'd let him die.

323
00:17:25.820 --> 00:17:28.320
[ZORO]
Well, In that case...

324
00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:29.530
You're gonna go too?

325
00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:30.740
You're wounded!

326
00:17:30.740 --> 00:17:32.030
Yeah, so what?

327
00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:36.030
the injury to my reputation's a lot
worse than the injury to my gut.

328
00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:42.960
Well, if we want to get to the Grand Line...
we better go steal that chart back!

329
00:17:42.960 --> 00:17:45.380
Ha! Are you gonna
join our crew or what?

330
00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:46.090
Huh?

331
00:17:46.090 --> 00:17:47.340
Come on.

332
00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:50.170
I'll never sink so low
as to become a pirate.

333
00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.880
[LUFFY gasps]

334
00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:56.560
But I suppose we could team up,
in order to achieve our common goal.

335
00:17:56.560 --> 00:17:57.560
[LUFFY laughs]

336
00:17:57.560 --> 00:17:59.850
[HENCHMAN J]
The second shot is ready, sir.

337
00:17:59.850 --> 00:18:01.640
All right then, fire.

338
00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.520
[BOODLE]
Come out, Buggy the Clown!

339
00:18:04.520 --> 00:18:07.190
[panting]

340
00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:10.030
I'm Mayor Boodle and this
town is my treasure!

341
00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:14.320
I won't let you terrorize my people
any longer, so come out and fight me!

342
00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:16.780
You idiot! This town is no treasure!

343
00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.990
Treasure is gold, silver, and jewelry.

344
00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:22.250
So cut the crap, old man,
and get outta here before I kill you.

345
00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:24.750
You could never understand how I feel!

346
00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.210
[BUGGY laughs]

347
00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:30.630
[BUGGY] Soon I'm going to conquer the Grand Line
and flashily obtain all the world's riches,

348
00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:32.840
and there's nothing
you can do to stop me!

349
00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:34.760
All the world will belong to me.

350
00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.850
Now, if this town means so much to you,

351
00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:39.220
then perhaps I'll do you a
favor and kill you first,

352
00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:42.180
that way you won't have to see
me destroy your precious village.

353
00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:43.520
[BOODLE grunting]

354
00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:46.060
Shut up... and fight me already!

355
00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:47.690
Don't get cocky!

356
00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:51.740
I'll never let you destroy this town,
if it costs me my very life!

357
00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:53.650
[BUGGY laughs]
So be it!

358
00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:54.990
[gasps]

359
00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:59.030
That straw hat! Not again!

360
00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:07.540
I'm here to kick your ass, just
like I promised I would, Buggy!

361
00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.720
How dare you!

362
00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:20.680
You can't just waltz up to
me and treat me like this!

363
00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:23.810
I'm Captain Buggy
and I won't stand for it!

364
00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.810
Listen to me, all I want is the chart

365
00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:28.400
and the treasure then I'm
out of here, you got it?

366
00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:29.690
Yeah, I got it.

367
00:19:29.690 --> 00:19:30.770
[BOODLE coughs]

368
00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.780
Get outta here. Why'd you follow me?

369
00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:37.280
You're outsiders, leave
this to me. [groans]

370
00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:42.790
This is my fight that I need
to be the one to protect my town!

371
00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.040
[BOODLE grunts]

372
00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:47.330
Buggy is my fight!

373
00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:51.040
[NAMI gasps]

374
00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.380
[BUGGY]
Huh?

375
00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:55.170
[BOODLE groans]

376
00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:58.300
What the hell do you
think you're doing?!

377
00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:00.510
Why'd you knock out the mayor?!

378
00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:02.720
Because.

379
00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:03.520
[NAMI gasps]

380
00:20:03.520 --> 00:20:05.180
That's not a bad idea.

381
00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:08.400
If the old man had continued
to fight he would have died.

382
00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:09.940
That's for the best.

383
00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:12.400
You didn't have to hit him!
I'm sure we could have

384
00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:15.940
thought of a more humane way
to deal with the situation!

385
00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:28.580
That's the worst thing you
could have said to him!

386
00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:31.790
[BUGGY]
Ohh... You damn flashy idiot!

387
00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:34.460
I won't stand for this.

388
00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.670
Take aim and fire the Buggy Ball!

389
00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:40.300
Why'd you have to say that?

390
00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:41.760
Come on Luffy, we gotta go!

391
00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:42.970
You go ahead.

392
00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:44.010
Time to die!

393
00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:44.850
I'm fine.

394
00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:46.850
Just watch!

395
00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:51.650
Gum-Gum Balloon!

396
00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:54.020
[NAMI gasps]

397
00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.190
[HENCHMEN gasping]

398
00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:56.440
What is he?

399
00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.030
Did he catch the Buggy Ball?!

400
00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.570
– [HENCHMEN screaming]
– [CLOWN HENCHMAN] Run for it!

401
00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:04.160
He coulda warned me.

402
00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:06.160
[BUGGY, HENCHMEN screaming]

403
00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:14.290
All right! I got 'em!

404
00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:16.630
What the hell kinda monster are you?

405
00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:18.380
I think you freaked her out.

406
00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:30.190
[NAMI] I knew that something was weird
after you survived the fight with that lion.

407
00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:32.150
No human being can do what you do!

408
00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:33.860
Now explain yourself!

409
00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:37.320
What the hell was the balloon
inflatey thing that you did just now?!

410
00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:39.110
That was the Gum-Gum Balloon.

411
00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:41.700
I don't care what you call it,
just tell me how you did it!

412
00:21:41.700 --> 00:21:43.740
What are you, some kind of freak?

413
00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:45.240
[BUGGY groans]

414
00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:48.830
[BUGGY]
How dare you try to flashily do me in?

415
00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:54.960
Unreal...

416
00:21:54.960 --> 00:21:56.630
Using his men as a shield.

417
00:21:59.050 --> 00:22:03.680
[MOHJI groaning]

418
00:22:03.680 --> 00:22:04.590
[MOHJI]
Hm?

419
00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:06.720
What in the world just happened here?

420
00:22:07.350 --> 00:22:09.310
[MOHJI grunts]

421
00:22:09.310 --> 00:22:11.600
No! It's you!

422
00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:12.560
Hi!

423
00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:14.810
[MOHJI screaming]
It's that damn Straw Hat!

424
00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:17.020
Captain Buggy! We have to be careful!

425
00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:19.730
He has Devil Fruit powers, too!
He's a rubber person!

426
00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:21.150
I saw it myself!

427
00:22:21.150 --> 00:22:22.490
What?

428
00:22:22.490 --> 00:22:23.610
Rubber person?

429
00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:25.660
Yeah... See?

430
00:22:25.660 --> 00:22:26.410
[NAMI yelps]

431
00:22:26.410 --> 00:22:28.160
A Devil Fruit.

432
00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:32.500
That explains how he bounced
that Buggy Ball back at us.

433
00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:33.500
[MOHJI]
Huh?

434
00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:40.550
<b>Cabaji "the Acrobat"
First Officer of the Buggy Pirates</b>

435
00:22:35.630 --> 00:22:40.550
[CABAJI] How do you plan
to respond to this insult... Captain?

436
00:22:40.550 --> 00:22:43.430
Oh, Cabaji... I don't know.

437
00:22:43.430 --> 00:22:45.510
I'm too angry to even fart.

438
00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:46.760
Put him down, Cabaji!

439
00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:48.970
What the hell did you do to my Richie?!

440
00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:50.180
[CABAJI]
This cat?

441
00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:53.690
I used it as a shield, to keep
my clothes from getting dirty.

442
00:22:54.980 --> 00:22:56.480
[MOHJI]
Richie!

443
00:22:58.440 --> 00:22:59.360
No, Richie!

444
00:22:59.360 --> 00:23:00.400
Say something, please!

445
00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:01.320
Richie!

446
00:23:05.530 --> 00:23:07.370
– [RICHIE whimpers]
– [MOHJI] Richie?!

447
00:23:07.370 --> 00:23:10.040
Damn you, you bastard!

448
00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:10.580
[MOHJI yells]

449
00:23:10.620 --> 00:23:11.910
[MOHJI screams]

450
00:23:11.910 --> 00:23:13.500
Out of my way!

451
00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:16.540
How about... Outta my way!

452
00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:19.130
[MOHJI yells, grunts]

453
00:23:27.010 --> 00:23:29.350
[CABAJI]
You may call me Acrobat Cabaji.

454
00:23:29.350 --> 00:23:31.770
Captain Buggy's Chief of Staff.

455
00:23:31.770 --> 00:23:34.020
You will pay for your insolence!

456
00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:36.650
[LUFFY gasps]

457
00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:37.980
[ZORO]
I'll clash swords with you.

458
00:23:39.690 --> 00:23:42.570
[CABAJI]
It's an honor, Roronoa Zoro.

459
00:23:42.570 --> 00:23:47.660
As a swordsman myself, I relish
this chance to slay you.

460
00:23:47.660 --> 00:23:49.240
[CABAJI]
Hm.

461
00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:50.330
Hey Zoro?

462
00:23:50.330 --> 00:23:52.950
You really should get some rest.
Let me handle this guy.

463
00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:54.960
[ZORO]
Just stay back.

464
00:23:54.960 --> 00:23:57.500
[CABAJI] That's the stab wound
the Captain inflicted on him.

465
00:23:57.500 --> 00:23:58.960
The fool...

466
00:23:58.960 --> 00:24:01.340
Arsonist... Technique!

467
00:24:01.340 --> 00:24:04.420
[ZORO grunting]

468
00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:05.800
[LUFFY gasps]

469
00:24:05.800 --> 00:24:06.800
[NAMI yelps]

470
00:24:08.390 --> 00:24:11.220
[yells]

471
00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:12.430
[CABAJI]
What's wrong?

472
00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:14.930
I didn't kick you that hard, now did I?

473
00:24:14.930 --> 00:24:15.930
He fights dirty!

474
00:24:15.930 --> 00:24:18.560
Going after his injury like that!

475
00:24:19.230 --> 00:24:20.560
[BUGGY chuckles]

476
00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:22.270
[CABAJI]
Acrobat Technique...

477
00:24:22.270 --> 00:24:24.530
Murder at the Steam Bath!

478
00:24:26.320 --> 00:24:29.860
Acrobat my ass. That's just
an ordinary dust cloud!

479
00:24:29.860 --> 00:24:31.240
[ZORO gasps]

480
00:24:31.240 --> 00:24:32.740
[CABAJI grunts]

481
00:24:33.620 --> 00:24:35.330
[yelling]

482
00:24:35.330 --> 00:24:36.960
He did it again!

483
00:24:37.580 --> 00:24:38.580
[ZORO grunting]

484
00:24:38.580 --> 00:24:39.920
[CABAJI]
What's this?

485
00:24:39.920 --> 00:24:43.500
It's such a disgraceful sight
to see a grown man moaning.

486
00:24:43.500 --> 00:24:49.180
I suppose now you can see how foolish it
was to make an enemy of the Buggy Pirates.

487
00:24:50.890 --> 00:24:52.300
He's hurt so bad.

488
00:24:52.300 --> 00:24:55.430
I don't know how he's
managing to stay in the fight.

489
00:24:55.430 --> 00:24:57.390
Why are you just standing
there watching him?!

490
00:24:57.390 --> 00:24:59.100
He's gonna get himself
killed, you know!

491
00:24:59.100 --> 00:25:02.060
[ZORO grunting]

492
00:25:06.480 --> 00:25:10.160
Roronoa Zoro... is finished!

493
00:25:11.110 --> 00:25:12.740
You annoying little bastard.

494
00:25:14.740 --> 00:25:17.040
You havin' fun pokin' at my wound?

495
00:25:17.040 --> 00:25:19.330
Then go ahead!

496
00:25:20.620 --> 00:25:21.330
[CABAJI gasps]

497
00:25:21.330 --> 00:25:22.130
[NAMI gasps]

498
00:25:22.130 --> 00:25:25.880
Ouchie!

499
00:25:25.880 --> 00:25:27.590
[CABAJI]
Huh?

500
00:25:27.590 --> 00:25:30.340
Uh... Why didn't you dodge his attack?

501
00:25:31.220 --> 00:25:33.970
[ZORO]
Is that enough of a handicap for ya?

502
00:25:35.510 --> 00:25:40.440
And now let me show you, just how
superior my skills are to yours.

503
00:25:40.440 --> 00:25:41.440
[CABAJI gasps]

504
00:25:41.440 --> 00:25:43.610
Yeah, Zoro! Get 'em!

505
00:25:43.610 --> 00:25:47.230
You fool, you've made
a vast error in judgment.

506
00:25:47.230 --> 00:25:49.070
I won't be mocked.

507
00:25:49.070 --> 00:25:52.780
[ZORO] My swords aim
to be the world's greatest.

508
00:25:52.780 --> 00:25:58.080
I refuse to lose even once to anyone
who calls himself a swordsman.

509
00:25:58.080 --> 00:25:59.750
[CABAJI]
I see.

510
00:25:59.750 --> 00:26:03.580
A strong resolve keeps
you going. But have no fear.

511
00:26:04.630 --> 00:26:08.000
Wounds as bad as yours will be
more than enough of an excuse.

512
00:26:09.550 --> 00:26:12.010
[CABAJI]
For losing to me!

513
00:26:12.010 --> 00:26:13.470
[ZORO]
To hell with that.

514
00:26:15.140 --> 00:26:19.350
If I lose to someone like you,
even with these minimal injuries,

515
00:26:19.350 --> 00:26:22.770
then I don't have a very
bright future ahead of me do I?

516
00:26:24.230 --> 00:26:25.560
[CABAJI]
Why you...

517
00:26:25.560 --> 00:26:27.570
Alright! Yeah!

518
00:26:28.230 --> 00:26:29.780
[gasps]

519
00:26:29.780 --> 00:26:31.530
I won't stay and watch this.

520
00:26:31.530 --> 00:26:34.450
You pirates can stand
around for the rest of time

521
00:26:34.450 --> 00:26:36.530
and kill each other for all I care.

522
00:26:36.530 --> 00:26:40.540
I mean it doesn't matter to me
whether you guys win or lose!

523
00:26:40.540 --> 00:26:44.670
I'm gonna take this opportunity to swipe
their treasure and get outta here.

524
00:26:44.670 --> 00:26:46.420
[LUFFY]
Huh?

525
00:26:46.420 --> 00:26:49.340
Maybe we can team up again
if we ever get the chance.

526
00:26:49.340 --> 00:26:50.260
See ya!

527
00:26:50.260 --> 00:26:51.460
Good luck with the fight!

528
00:26:51.460 --> 00:26:53.680
Yeah, thanks! See ya!

529
00:26:53.680 --> 00:26:56.640
[CABAJI] Here's a taste
of my ultimate acrobatic move!

530
00:27:00.220 --> 00:27:01.640
[CABAJI]
Acrobat Technique...

531
00:27:01.640 --> 00:27:04.600
The Dance of a Hundred Kamikaze Tops!

532
00:27:08.730 --> 00:27:10.360
Acrobat Technique...

533
00:27:10.860 --> 00:27:12.240
A Hike in the Mountains!

534
00:27:12.240 --> 00:27:13.240
[ZORO]
Huh?

535
00:27:13.240 --> 00:27:16.240
[CABAJI]
Fireworks in the Cool Summer Breeze!

536
00:27:16.240 --> 00:27:18.370
Whoa! That's high!

537
00:27:18.370 --> 00:27:21.490
[CABAJI]
Sting of the Unicycle!

538
00:27:21.490 --> 00:27:23.000
Ground-Hugging...

539
00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:24.830
Chop-Chop Cannon!

540
00:27:27.500 --> 00:27:29.670
Cabaji, I'll hold him!

541
00:27:29.670 --> 00:27:31.250
Then you finish him off!

542
00:27:31.250 --> 00:27:32.420
Done!

543
00:27:33.970 --> 00:27:35.430
[ZORO]
Damn it!

544
00:27:37.970 --> 00:27:39.300
[yells]

545
00:27:42.020 --> 00:27:43.140
Luffy...

546
00:27:43.140 --> 00:27:46.190
[BUGGY yelling]
You bastard!

547
00:27:46.190 --> 00:27:50.150
If you wanna fight
someone... how about me?

548
00:27:53.070 --> 00:27:55.740
[CABAJI laughs]
I assure you

549
00:27:55.740 --> 00:27:58.660
I don't need my Captain's
help to finish you off.

550
00:27:58.660 --> 00:28:02.410
Enough... I'm tired of this.

551
00:28:02.410 --> 00:28:07.420
[CABAJI laughing]
So you've finally given up, have you?

552
00:28:07.420 --> 00:28:09.750
I must say, I'm quite
impressed that you lasted

553
00:28:09.750 --> 00:28:12.000
that long with such serious injuries.

554
00:28:12.000 --> 00:28:13.630
[ZORO]
I think you misunderstood.

555
00:28:13.630 --> 00:28:16.880
I'm tired of watching your
boring little side show.

556
00:28:18.550 --> 00:28:19.970
[CABAJI gasps]

557
00:28:19.970 --> 00:28:22.680
So sorry to have disappointed you.

558
00:28:22.680 --> 00:28:24.270
How about...

559
00:28:24.270 --> 00:28:24.930
[CABAJI grunts]

560
00:28:24.930 --> 00:28:26.640
My real swordman skills!

561
00:28:26.640 --> 00:28:27.310
[LUFFY gasps]

562
00:28:27.310 --> 00:28:28.940
[BUGGY]
Heh!

563
00:28:28.940 --> 00:28:30.310
[CABAJI]
Die, Zoro!

564
00:28:32.440 --> 00:28:33.690
[ZORO]
Oni...

565
00:28:33.690 --> 00:28:34.780
[ZORO]
Giri!

566
00:28:38.110 --> 00:28:39.280
[CABAJI gasps]

567
00:28:39.280 --> 00:28:40.320
Cabaji!

568
00:28:42.280 --> 00:28:43.240
I can't believe

569
00:28:43.240 --> 00:28:44.410
the Buggy Pirates,

570
00:28:44.410 --> 00:28:46.960
were defeated by petty thieves.

571
00:28:51.500 --> 00:28:53.340
[ZORO]
We aren't petty thieves.

572
00:28:56.840 --> 00:28:58.050
We're pirates.

573
00:29:00.130 --> 00:29:02.970
Luffy...
I'm going to sleep.

574
00:29:02.970 --> 00:29:05.010
Good! I'm looking forward to this!

575
00:29:08.640 --> 00:29:10.730
[snoring]

576
00:29:10.730 --> 00:29:12.900
[BUGGY]
You guys are pirates?!

577
00:29:13.650 --> 00:29:14.440
[LUFFY]
Yeah!

578
00:29:14.440 --> 00:29:17.150
We're searching for the Grand Line!

579
00:29:17.150 --> 00:29:19.860
Ha! That's not an easy
voyage, you know?

580
00:29:19.860 --> 00:29:23.280
And I don't think that two halfwits
the likes of you can handle it.

581
00:29:23.280 --> 00:29:26.910
And what will you do if, by some
miracle, you manage to make it there?

582
00:29:26.910 --> 00:29:30.710
Go on a sightseeing tour
or something? [laughs]

583
00:29:33.790 --> 00:29:35.130
Be King of the Pirates!

584
00:29:35.130 --> 00:29:36.710
[BUGGY groans]

585
00:29:36.710 --> 00:29:38.840
You can't be serious, you idiot!

586
00:29:38.840 --> 00:29:42.640
If you were King of the Pirates,
then that would make me God!

587
00:29:42.640 --> 00:29:44.800
There's only one who can
be King of the Pirates

588
00:29:44.800 --> 00:29:48.930
and obtain all this world's treasures,
and that's gonna be me, you got it?!

589
00:29:48.930 --> 00:29:51.100
[LUFFY]
You're annoying.

590
00:29:51.100 --> 00:29:53.230
Let's go ahead and settle this!

591
00:29:55.770 --> 00:29:58.360
[BUGGY] Seeing that straw hat
brings back memories of him,

592
00:29:58.360 --> 00:30:00.150
and that really gets my blood boiling.

593
00:30:00.150 --> 00:30:02.820
So bring it on, you wannabe pirate!

594
00:30:02.820 --> 00:30:04.910
You remind me of him.

595
00:30:04.910 --> 00:30:07.990
That damn cheeky red-haired pirate!

596
00:30:07.990 --> 00:30:09.120
What did you say?

597
00:30:09.120 --> 00:30:10.960
The red hair...

598
00:30:10.960 --> 00:30:13.960
Wait, are you saying you
knew my old friend, Shanks?

599
00:30:13.960 --> 00:30:16.840
[BUGGY]
That's right. I knew Shanks once.

600
00:30:16.840 --> 00:30:18.210
Do you know where he is now?

601
00:30:18.210 --> 00:30:19.210
[BUGGY]
I don't know...

602
00:30:19.210 --> 00:30:21.090
I guess that depends, Straw Hat.

603
00:30:21.090 --> 00:30:24.430
Maybe I do and maybe I don't.

604
00:30:24.430 --> 00:30:25.970
What are you talking about?

605
00:30:25.970 --> 00:30:27.100
Did you forget?

606
00:30:27.100 --> 00:30:29.390
No, I didn't forget, you moron!

607
00:30:29.390 --> 00:30:33.230
But I'm not just gonna tell you where
he is outta the kindness of my heart.

608
00:30:33.230 --> 00:30:35.770
You have to work for that info!

609
00:30:35.770 --> 00:30:37.320
Fine! I'll make you tell me!

610
00:30:37.320 --> 00:30:38.820
[BUGGY laughs]

611
00:30:38.820 --> 00:30:42.740
You can give it your best shot,
but I don't like your chances.

612
00:30:42.740 --> 00:30:46.030
I doubt rubber can
bounce back from a blade!

613
00:30:46.030 --> 00:30:47.120
You're right.

614
00:30:47.120 --> 00:30:48.120
[NAMI grunts]

615
00:30:50.620 --> 00:30:54.170
[BUGGY]
Chop-Chop Rice Cracker!

616
00:30:55.750 --> 00:30:58.960
[BUGGY]
Can't move in midair, can you?

617
00:30:58.960 --> 00:31:00.090
Too bad!

618
00:31:00.090 --> 00:31:01.460
[BUGGY laughs]

619
00:31:01.460 --> 00:31:02.800
No, you're wrong!

620
00:31:03.840 --> 00:31:04.550
[LUFFY grunts]

621
00:31:04.550 --> 00:31:08.470
[BUGGY]
Ha. Ha. Oh, how interesting!

622
00:31:10.640 --> 00:31:13.270
You're not so bad either,
but here comes...

623
00:31:14.140 --> 00:31:16.020
Gum-Gum Pistol!

624
00:31:16.020 --> 00:31:17.900
They're neat abilities all right,

625
00:31:18.770 --> 00:31:21.530
but they leave you wide open.

626
00:31:21.530 --> 00:31:23.070
I'll carve you up!

627
00:31:23.070 --> 00:31:23.780
[LUFFY]
Gum-Gum...

628
00:31:23.780 --> 00:31:25.660
Chop-Chop Quick Escape!

629
00:31:26.110 --> 00:31:27.490
[LUFFY]
Sickle!

630
00:31:27.160 --> 00:31:28.530
[BUGGY]
Ha!

631
00:31:30.700 --> 00:31:33.500
[BUGGY laughs]

632
00:31:33.500 --> 00:31:36.000
Not good enough, Gum-Gum!

633
00:31:37.580 --> 00:31:39.540
[LUFFY groans]

634
00:31:39.540 --> 00:31:40.630
[LUFFY]
Hm!

635
00:31:42.090 --> 00:31:44.260
[LUFFY]
Damn, you keep breaking into pieces!

636
00:31:44.260 --> 00:31:44.970
What?

637
00:31:44.970 --> 00:31:47.050
They're still going at it?

638
00:31:47.050 --> 00:31:48.800
I can't believe these guys.

639
00:31:48.800 --> 00:31:51.810
Uh, hey, Did you see that?

640
00:31:51.810 --> 00:31:54.640
You dumbass, Pretend
you're still knocked out.

641
00:31:54.640 --> 00:31:56.770
If you get yourself caught
in the middle of that,

642
00:31:56.770 --> 00:31:59.770
Then there's no way you'll
ever make it out alive.

643
00:31:59.770 --> 00:32:01.730
Chop-Chop Canon!

644
00:32:03.610 --> 00:32:04.440
[LUFFY grunts]

645
00:32:04.440 --> 00:32:05.740
Separate!

646
00:32:05.740 --> 00:32:08.320
[LUFFY grunts]

647
00:32:08.320 --> 00:32:13.040
[BUGGY laughs]
So, runt, you wanna give up yet?

648
00:32:21.670 --> 00:32:22.630
You bastard!

649
00:32:22.630 --> 00:32:23.920
How's that?

650
00:32:23.920 --> 00:32:27.090
Was I not supposed to scratch
your face or something?

651
00:32:27.930 --> 00:32:29.260
Bastard...

652
00:32:29.260 --> 00:32:33.510
No one damages my lucky hat
and walks away from it alive!

653
00:32:33.510 --> 00:32:34.720
[BUGGY]
Heh?

654
00:32:34.720 --> 00:32:36.520
This hat is my only treasure!

655
00:32:36.520 --> 00:32:40.650
And anyone who so much as lays
a finger on it is gonna pay!

656
00:32:41.480 --> 00:32:42.320
Yeah...

657
00:32:42.320 --> 00:32:43.820
I made a solemn promise.

658
00:32:43.820 --> 00:32:45.690
I promised the guy who gave me this hat

659
00:32:45.690 --> 00:32:48.910
that I'd form a crew and become
the greatest pirate ever.

660
00:32:48.910 --> 00:32:53.490
And I didn't think that there
was anything that could faze him.

661
00:32:53.490 --> 00:32:55.040
But look at him.

662
00:32:55.040 --> 00:32:57.830
He's getting so upset about a hat.

663
00:32:57.830 --> 00:33:00.830
[LUFFY growls]

664
00:33:00.830 --> 00:33:04.000
[BUGGY] Hm... It seems
that hat has a history to it.

665
00:33:04.000 --> 00:33:05.510
[LUFFY]
That's right!

666
00:33:05.510 --> 00:33:07.840
[BUGGY]
Is it really all that special?

667
00:33:10.680 --> 00:33:13.890
[LUFFY gasps]

668
00:33:13.890 --> 00:33:16.890
If that's the case,
you should protect it!

669
00:33:18.020 --> 00:33:19.690
[LUFFY gasps]

670
00:33:33.410 --> 00:33:35.790
[SHANKS]
I'll leave this hat to you.

671
00:33:35.790 --> 00:33:39.660
It means more to me than anything in the world,
so you better take good care of it.

672
00:33:39.660 --> 00:33:40.790
You hear me?

673
00:33:40.790 --> 00:33:43.460
[LUFFY whimpering]

674
00:33:47.260 --> 00:33:50.470
[SHANKS] I want you to bring
this hat back to me someday.

675
00:33:50.470 --> 00:33:53.300
in good condition.

676
00:33:53.300 --> 00:33:56.260
And only once you've
become a great pirate.

677
00:33:56.260 --> 00:33:58.520
That's our promise, Luffy.

678
00:34:07.940 --> 00:34:11.490
You really consider this worthless
dirty straw hat a treasure?

679
00:34:11.490 --> 00:34:14.870
You need to grow up, boy. [laughs]

680
00:34:14.870 --> 00:34:16.160
Shut up.

681
00:34:16.910 --> 00:34:19.040
When Shanks gave me that,
I made a promise!

682
00:34:19.040 --> 00:34:20.250
[BUGGY]
What?

683
00:34:20.250 --> 00:34:23.750
So you're telling me that
this used to be Shanks' hat?

684
00:34:23.750 --> 00:34:26.750
No wonder it looked so familiar.

685
00:34:26.750 --> 00:34:29.130
He always wore it when I knew him.

686
00:34:28.550 --> 00:34:29.670
[LUFFY gasps]

687
00:34:29.670 --> 00:34:33.010
So you and Shanks were members
of the same pirate crew?

688
00:34:33.010 --> 00:34:36.470
Yeah, back when we were
pirates in training.

689
00:34:36.470 --> 00:34:38.720
We were fellow comrades.

690
00:34:38.720 --> 00:34:42.140
That damn detestable,
red-haired bastard!

691
00:34:42.140 --> 00:34:43.850
[LUFFY growls]

692
00:34:43.850 --> 00:34:46.480
Shanks is a much better
man then you'll ever be!

693
00:34:46.480 --> 00:34:48.730
You don't have the right
to call him comrade!

694
00:34:48.730 --> 00:34:51.360
And don't you ever bad-mouth him again!

695
00:34:51.360 --> 00:34:54.360
Time for my Chop-Chop
Quick Escape! [laughs]

696
00:34:54.360 --> 00:34:55.700
[LUFFY yells]

697
00:34:55.700 --> 00:34:57.530
[BUGGY groaning]

698
00:34:59.200 --> 00:35:03.540
I don't want you to ever mention
Shanks' name to me again, you bastard!

699
00:35:03.540 --> 00:35:06.500
[BUGGY gasping, coughing]

700
00:35:06.500 --> 00:35:09.710
I can say whatever the hell
I want about Shanks! [coughs]

701
00:35:12.630 --> 00:35:15.220
Tell me, what happened
between you and Shanks,

702
00:35:15.220 --> 00:35:16.680
and where can I find him now?

703
00:35:16.680 --> 00:35:17.550
[BUGGY grunting]

704
00:35:17.550 --> 00:35:18.510
[LUFFY]
Damn it!

705
00:35:18.510 --> 00:35:21.350
How dare you tear up my
treasured straw hat!

706
00:35:21.350 --> 00:35:23.770
[BUGGY coughs]

707
00:35:23.770 --> 00:35:26.560
[BUGGY]
Do you really wanna know?

708
00:35:26.560 --> 00:35:29.770
He's the one person that I loathe.

709
00:35:29.770 --> 00:35:33.570
I'll curse his name
for the rest of my life!

710
00:35:33.570 --> 00:35:37.110
As long as there's
breath in my body, Shanks.

711
00:35:37.110 --> 00:35:39.030
I will never...

712
00:35:39.030 --> 00:35:41.700
...forgive you.

713
00:35:45.620 --> 00:35:52.480
As a kid I had a dream of a dazzling treasure

714
00:35:52.680 --> 00:35:59.500
I had a map in my head that I knew would lead me

715
00:35:59.750 --> 00:36:06.600
Charted a course all on my own so nobody would beat me

716
00:36:06.720 --> 00:36:13.860
The promised land was in my hand drew a line in the sand

717
00:36:16.560 --> 00:36:19.240
Look where I am

718
00:36:21.470 --> 00:36:27.650
My one ambitions slipping right through my hands

719
00:36:27.990 --> 00:36:34.920
But if the world ever changes Ill call out your name

720
00:36:35.080 --> 00:36:42.000
We could return to a time when our lives were still the same

721
00:36:42.130 --> 00:36:49.130
Take me to the place where memories remain

722
00:36:49.230 --> 00:36:55.000
Please dont ever let them fade
